<title>USA: Interstate Johnson wins Richland Cty SD #1, S.C..</title>
<headline>Interstate Johnson wins Richland Cty SD #1, S.C..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate/Johnson Lane Corp said it won $60 million of Richland County School District No. 1, S.C., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost (NIC) of 5.08 percent.</p>
</text>
